{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Trust</b> — After he rebuked the fools, he returned to speak to the people with HaShem: 'Trust in Him' — therefore in the plural." "<b>Elohim is our refuge, selah</b> — For it is to the people with HaShem, and he mentioned 'refuge,' corresponding to 'my refuge is in Elohim.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 62, :notes {0 "The Hebrew reads המהותתים ('the fools'); the word is unusual and may be a variant or rare form; translated literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:31.625109227Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}